<title>USA: St. Michael 885, Minn. $3.590 mln won by Piper.</title>
<headline>St. Michael 885, Minn. $3.590 mln won by Piper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $3.590 million of St.Michael-Albertville ISD 885, Minn., general obligation school building refunding bonds, Series 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 4.8432 percent.</p>
</text>
